Package: GXBioAge
Type: Package
Title: Gompertz-X Biological Age from a Survival Model
Version: 0.3.0
Date: 2026-09-11
Authors@R: person("Xin", "Gao", email = "gaoxin_0612@163.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  comment = c(ORCID = ""))
Description: GXBioAge — Gompertz-X Biological Age (the suffix "X" denotes
    five clinical laboratory biomarkers used for model construction) — is a
    biological age (BioAge) estimator based on a Gompertz survival
    regression trained on NHANES data. The model uses chronological age
    plus five routine blood markers — Total Cholesterol (TC), C-Reactive
    Protein (CRP), Platelet count (PLT), Creatinine (CREA) and White Blood
    Cell count (WBC) — and returns both BioAge and the BioAge-to-
    chronological age difference (BioAgeDiff). Provides four interfaces:
    a single-subject calculator (\code{calc_bioage}), a data-frame batch
    predictor (\code{predict_bioage}), a CSV/TSV file reader that
    returns a results table (\code{predict_bioage_file}), and a set of
    ggplot2-based batch-result visualisations
    (\code{plot_bioage_cor}, \code{plot_bioage_diff}). Citation:
    (Pending publication).
